import { Palette } from "std-widgets.slint";

export enum ForgeSplitOrientation { horizontal, vertical }

// 子项绑定两侧的公开几何属性；分隔条支持水平或垂直拖动。
export component ForgeSplitLayout inherits Rectangle {
    in-out property<float> ratio: 0.5;
    in property<ForgeSplitOrientation> orientation: ForgeSplitOrientation.horizontal;
    in property<length> divider-size: 8px;
    private property<float> effective-ratio: Math.max(0, Math.min(1, root.ratio));
    private property<length> effective-divider: Math.max(0px, Math.min(root.divider-size,
        root.orientation == ForgeSplitOrientation.horizontal ? root.width : root.height));
    out property<length> first-width: root.orientation == ForgeSplitOrientation.horizontal
        ? Math.max(0px, Math.min(root.width - root.effective-divider, root.width * root.effective-ratio - root.effective-divider / 2)) : root.width;
    out property<length> first-height: root.orientation == ForgeSplitOrientation.vertical
        ? Math.max(0px, Math.min(root.height - root.effective-divider, root.height * root.effective-ratio - root.effective-divider / 2)) : root.height;
    out property<length> second-x: root.orientation == ForgeSplitOrientation.horizontal ? root.first-width + root.effective-divider : 0px;
    out property<length> second-y: root.orientation == ForgeSplitOrientation.vertical ? root.first-height + root.effective-divider : 0px;
    out property<length> second-width: root.orientation == ForgeSplitOrientation.horizontal ? Math.max(0px, root.width - root.second-x) : root.width;
    out property<length> second-height: root.orientation == ForgeSplitOrientation.vertical ? Math.max(0px, root.height - root.second-y) : root.height;
    callback ratio-changed(float);
    background: Palette.background;
    clip: true;
    @children
    divider := Rectangle {
        x: root.orientation == ForgeSplitOrientation.horizontal ? root.first-width : 0px;
        y: root.orientation == ForgeSplitOrientation.vertical ? root.first-height : 0px;
        width: root.orientation == ForgeSplitOrientation.horizontal ? root.effective-divider : parent.width;
        height: root.orientation == ForgeSplitOrientation.vertical ? root.effective-divider : parent.height;
        background: Palette.divider;
        TouchArea {
            property<float> pressed-ratio: root.ratio;
            property<length> pressed-root-x: 0px;
            property<length> pressed-root-y: 0px;
            mouse-cursor: root.orientation == ForgeSplitOrientation.horizontal ? col-resize : row-resize;
            pointer-event(event) => {
                if (event.kind == PointerEventKind.down) {
                    self.pressed-ratio = root.effective-ratio;
                    self.pressed-root-x = divider.x + self.pressed-x;
                    self.pressed-root-y = divider.y + self.pressed-y;
                }
            }
            moved => {
                if (self.pressed && root.width > 0px && root.height > 0px) {
                    // 鼠标局部坐标会随分隔条移动，先换算到固定的组件坐标系。
                    root.ratio = Math.max(0.15, Math.min(0.85,
                        self.pressed-ratio + (root.orientation == ForgeSplitOrientation.horizontal
                            ? (divider.x + self.mouse-x - self.pressed-root-x) / root.width
                            : (divider.y + self.mouse-y - self.pressed-root-y) / root.height)));
                    root.ratio-changed(root.ratio);
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
